### Verify Token 200 Success
POST http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}/api/verify-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "your_token_here"
}

### Verify Token 401 Unauthorized - Invalid token
POST http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}/api/verify-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "invalid_token"
}

### Verify Token 422 Unprocessable Entity - Missing token field
POST http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}/api/verify-token
Content-Type: application/json

{}
